---
layout: base.njk
title: Work
description: Case studies from Vertis Global engagements across data, AI, cloud, managed services, and staffing. Real engagements with real metrics.
permalink: /work/
---

<section class="section pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-24">
  <div class="wrapper grid-edit">
    <div class="col-span-12">
      <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-hero leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.035em] text-balance reveal-mask">
        <span>Shipped work.</span>
        <span class="block italic text-ink-secondary">Real metrics.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 md:mt-10 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl text-ink-secondary reveal reveal-delay-2 pretty">
        Engagement narratives written by the team on the project. What we built, what broke, what we would do again. Customer names anonymized where NDAs apply.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section border-t border-ink-primary">
  <div class="wrapper">
    {% set work = collections.work %}
    {% if work and work.length %}
      <ul>
        {% for c in work %}
          <li class="reveal reveal-delay-{{ (loop.index0 % 4) + 1 }}">
            <a href="{{ c.url }}" class="group flex items-start gap-5 md:gap-8 py-10 md:py-14 border-t border-ink-primary {% if loop.last %}border-b{% endif %} transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bg-subtle">
              <span class="meta pt-2 text-ink-secondary shrink-0">{{ '0' + loop.index | string if loop.index < 10 else loop.index }}</span>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-3">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                  {% if c.data.industry %}<span class="meta text-ink-secondary">{{ c.data.industry }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {% if c.data.year %}<span class="meta text-ink-tertiary">{{ c.data.year }}</span>{% endif %}
                </div>
                <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]">{{ c.data.title }}</h2>
                {% if c.data.tagline %}<p class="font-display italic text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink-secondary">{{ c.data.tagline }}</p>{% endif %}
                {% if c.data.description %}<p class="mt-1 text-ink-secondary pretty max-w-3xl">{{ c.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
              </div>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="mt-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h12m0 0L9 3m5 5l-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% else %}
      <div class="reveal py-16 md:py-24 flex flex-col gap-8 max-w-3xl">
        <span class="meta" style="color: var(--color-pixel-purple)">
          <span class="section-number" style="--accent: var(--color-pixel-purple)">In progress</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] balance">
          First case studies land with the public launch.
        </h2>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-statement">
  <div class="wrapper grid-edit">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5">
      <span class="meta section-number reveal" style="--accent: var(--color-pixel-purple); color: var(--color-ink-inverse-secondary)">Before you ask</span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.025em] mt-6 balance reveal">
        Customer names on request.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7 md:pl-8">
      <p class="text-ink-inverse-secondary max-w-xl pretty reveal reveal-delay-1">
        The case studies are anonymized where NDAs apply. Customer names, contact references, and deeper architecture detail are available on a qualified call. Start with a note and tell us which study matches what you are evaluating.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn bg-transparent text-ink-inverse border-ink-inverse-secondary mt-8 hover:bg-ink-inverse hover:text-ink-primary hover:border-ink-inverse reveal reveal-delay-2">
        Ask for references
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h10m0 0L8 3m4 4l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
